## Layout

```
charts/<name>/
  Chart.yaml
  values.yaml
  templates/
```

## Publish destinations

- **Primary**: `oci://harbor.fartlab.dev/charts/<name>` (Harbor)
- **Secondary**: Forgejo Packages (OCI registry on `${git_provider.host}`)

Publish triggers on push to `main` when `charts/<name>/Chart.yaml`
version bumps.

